# r2_harness.oot — R2 Multi-Import Type Check path-A harness pointer
# Date: 2026-08-12
# Scope: SPRINT R2 smoke rails only (no Domain Expert product land)
## Harness
| Item | Path |
|------|------|
| Smoke | `ooda/scripts/r2_multi_import_tc_smoke.oo` |
| Binary | `OODAC_BIN` or `ooda/oodac/oodac` |
| Fixtures | ephemeral under `$TMPDIR/r2_multi_import_tc_$$` (not repo root) |

## Rails
| Kind | Case |
|------|------|
| PASS | 2-file import call (`helper()` across import) |
| PASS | struct type across import (`Point` + make + field sum) |
| FAIL | arg type mismatch across import (String → Int param) |
| FAIL | missing import fail-closed |

Exit 0 only if all four rails hold.

## Run
```
cd /home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA/ooda
OODAC_BIN=./oodac/oodac bash scripts/r2_multi_import_tc_smoke.oo
```

